 <Dialog open={heroChoice!==null} onOpenChange={o=>!o&&setHeroChoice(null)}><DialogContent><DialogTitle>{me?.heroLocked?'Change to':'Choose'} {heroChoice!==null?defenders[heroChoice].name:''}?</DialogTitle><DialogDescription>{me?.heroLocked?'Changing costs 1,000 coins. All your deployed heroes change together. Keep your clothes, weapons and upgrade levels. Your old character becomes available to a classmate.':'Your first hero is free and reserved for you. Every extra defender you deploy uses this character. Changing later costs 1,000 coins.'}</DialogDescription>{heroChoice!==null&&<Sprite type={heroChoice} gender={heroGender} className="detail-sprite" outfit='none'/>}<fieldset className="starter-options"><legend>Your hero</legend>{(['boy','girl'] as const).map(g=><label key={g}><input type="radio" name="hero-gender" checked={heroGender===g} onChange={()=>setHeroGender(g)}/>{g==='boy'?'Boy':'Girl'}</label>)}</fieldset>{me?.heroLocked&&heroChoice!==null&&<StatsPanel type={heroChoice} weapon={ownDefenders[0]?.weapon??'standard'} level={ownDefenders[0]?.level||1} loadout={me} compare={buildStats(me.hero,ownDefenders[0]?.level||1,ownDefenders[0]?.weapon??'standard',me)}/>}<p>Start with your character’s own look. Answer questions to earn coins, then buy individual clothes in SHUS.</p><button className="primary" disabled={busy||!!liveBattle||world.players.some((p:any)=>p.id!==me?.id&&p.hero===heroChoice)} onClick={async()=>{const r=await action({action:'hero',hero:heroChoice,gender:heroGender},'Your hero is ready!');if(r)setHeroChoice(null)}}>{me?.heroLocked?'Change hero · 1,000 coins':'Choose first hero · Free'}</button>{world.players.some((p:any)=>p.id!==me?.id&&p.hero===heroChoice)&&<p role="alert">A classmate has just chosen this hero. Please choose another.</p>}<button className="secondary-button" onClick={()=>setHeroChoice(null)}>Keep choosing</button></DialogContent></Dialog>
